action-not-first	error	a step statement appears above the step's action block
bad-arity	error	a call or a browser action has the wrong number of arguments
bad-value	error	a value is the wrong kind for the position it is in
duplicate-action	error	a step block contains more than one action block
invalid-duration	error	a string in a duration position is not a duration
invalid-escape	error	a string literal contains an escape the language does not define
invalid-regex	error	a regex literal does not compile
missing-action	error	a step block contains no action block, so the step has no type
missing-separator	error	two statements run together with no newline or comma between them
nesting-too-deep	error	a file nests deeper than the parser will descend
non-associative-operator	error	a comparison operator is chained with another
not-in-scope	error	a name is not bound in this step's type
reserved-word	error	a word reserved for a later tier is used as a name
unclosed-block	error	a "{", "(" or "[" is never closed
unclosed-interpolation	error	a "${" in a string has no closing "}"
unclosed-interpolation-expr	error	a "${" expression is followed by neither "}" nor more string
unexpected-character	error	a byte in the source starts no token
unexpected-token	error	a token appears where the grammar wanted another
unknown-config	error	a "config" names a subject the language does not configure
unknown-field	error	an identifier names no field of anything in scope
unknown-identifier	error	a name is bound nowhere in the file
unknown-type	error	the right-hand side of "is" is not a type name
unterminated-regex	error	a regex literal has no closing slash
unterminated-string	error	a string literal has no closing quote
